---
description: Tikal router — load only the stacks listed in tikal.yaml
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `tikal.yaml` (or `.tikal.yaml`) at the repository root, then follow @ai-coding-tools/processes/getting-started.md. Load only `ai-coding-tools/stacks/<type>/` for each entry in `project.types` and that type's implied bases (`astro` always loads `typescript`). Do not load other stacks.
